**Authors:** Qiusi Zhan et al.

**Year:** 2024

**Relevance:**
Provides an implementation and benchmark for studying indirect prompt injection vulnerabilities in tool-integrated LLM agents.

**GitHub:**
https://github.com/uiuc-kang-lab/InjecAgent

**Paper:**
https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.02691

