## 20. Bisimulation Makes Analogies in Goal-Conditioned Reinforcement Learning

**Authors:** Philippe Hansen-Estruch, Amy Zhang, Ashvin Nair, Patrick Yin, Sergey Levine

**Year:** 2022

**Venue:** ICML 2022

**Relevance:**
Studies how agents can infer and generalize goals across different environments. This provides useful background for reliable goal interpretation and generalization.

**Paper:**
https://proceedings.mlr.press/v162/hansen-estruch22a.html

